# Optional: endpoint that expands Google Maps short links (maps.app.goo.gl,
# goo.gl, g.co). Browsers cannot read Google's redirect because it has no CORS
# headers. Use the worker in worker/shortlink.js, or any endpoint that returns
# { "url": "..." }, { "placeId": "..." }, { "cid": "..." }, or plain text.
VITE_SHORTLINK_RESOLVER="https://reviewlink-shortlink.example.workers.dev/?url={url}"
